---
title: ":spaghetti: Skillet Rotini, Tomatoes & Cheese"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 6
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
total time: 25 minutes
tags:
  - main
  - pasta
  - italian
  - skillet
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #large skillet{}, sauté and crumble @vegetarian Italian sausage{1%lb} in @olive oil{2%tsp}.

Add @green onions, cut into 1-inch diagonal pieces{5} and cooked @rotini pasta{4%cups}, sautéing until lightly golden.

Add drained @diced tomatoes{14.5%oz%can}; cook ~{2%minutes}.

Combine @ricotta cheese{15%oz%container} and @milk{1/4%cup}; add to pasta mixture, mixing well until evenly coated.

Add @fresh basil, slivered{1/4%cup}, @salt{}, and @pepper{} to taste. Cook until heated through.
